WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.368
- The thing that the
left has done very,

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:04.804
very effectively
is claimed to have

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:08.241 align:start size:97% position:3%
a monopoly on morality
because it defines morality

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.943
in quite a narrow way itself.

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:13.747
It has to be essentially
rationally calculable.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.148
But actually, if
you think about it,

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:18.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of what we actually
do that is moral,

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:20.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
is actually very
sentimental and habitual.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.288
We didn't think about it.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
We just do it because it's
the right thing to do.

00:00:24.556 --> 00:00:27.727 align:start size:97% position:3%
And so if you are actually
taking principles like freedom

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:28.995
and inequality,

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.396
well actually you can
destroy the family

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:31.664
with those principles.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.566
You know, you don't owe
anything to your parents

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.969 align:start size:97% position:3%
and you can't say that your
your father is superior

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.637 align:start size:84% position:16%
to you because
that's not equality.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.106
And so you're not
bound by being...

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.474
You didn't choose
your parents but...

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.543 align:start size:88% position:13%
And so by the principles
of freedom, equality,

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.712
you can be unbound
from your own family.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.381
And like children can
have no responsibility

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.883
to not only their parents,

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.184
but their own country and
to anything like that.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.353
It's like, God, this is
actually quite horrific.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:55.989
(relaxed music)

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:05.498
- Do I call you Carl or do
I call you Sargon of Akkad

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.233 align:start size:88% position:13%
now that we are
officially sitting down

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.603
once again after many years?

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:11.804
- I think Carl will do.

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:12.639
- Carl will do?

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.173
- Carl will do.

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:16.942
- Alright, there is a lot I
want to talk about with you.

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:19.645 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I said to you right
before we started of all weeks

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:23.349 align:start position:0%
for you to be in America,
'cause you live across the pond,

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.351
you came the very week
that we're opening up

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:26.953
this studio to in-person guests.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:28.787
And for people who do not know,

00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:30.556
who haven't been with
me since the beginning

00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:34.060
of the beginning, when I
was waking up to the left.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.528
What's going on with the left?

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.429
Why are we calling
everybody racist?

00:01:37.429 --> 00:01:39.131
No one's actually
acting liberally.

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:40.066
- Yeah.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.068
- The Sargon of Akkad story.

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.804
Everybody online, all
the commenters said,

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:48.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Dave, you gotta watch
this guy Sargon of Akaad."

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.876 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't know that your
face was even in the videos

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:51.111
at that time.

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.412
But everybody said,

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.080
"You gotta watch Sargon
of Akaad (indistinct)."

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.648
I started watching your
videos and I'm going,

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Wow, this guy's a liberal
and he makes sense."

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.286
And then eventually
we started talking.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.955
You had me on your show,

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.822 align:start size:84% position:16%
and in some ways
the rest is history.

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:06.159 align:start size:97% position:3%
So I think I've done it once
or twice over the years,

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:10.129
but I give you serious cred
for getting me here today

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:12.231
