the first in that way.

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:17.069
So give the people like the
two-minute bio about you

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:18.638
first and then we'll
get into the politics

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.172
and the fighting
and the craziness

00:02:20.172 --> 00:02:21.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the state of the
world and the rest of it.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:22.675
- Yeah, yeah.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.976
- And welcome to the
free state of Florida.

00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:25.211
- It's beautiful.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.112
It's so much nicer
than California.

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.046
(Dave laughing)

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.548
There's greenery around, right.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.850
I'm from England, so if I'm
