00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.317
I get a bit weird and edgy.

00:02:32.317 --> 00:02:35.722 align:start position:0%
And California is just this
brown blasted hellscape of dirt,

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:39.292 align:start size:97% position:3%
whereas Florida, it's
luscious, genuinely luscious.

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:40.793
- You're speaking my language.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.429 align:start size:97% position:3%
- It's crazy 'cause I was
the same though, in, for me,

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:48.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
it happened in about 2012,
2013, where I was just,

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.136 align:start position:0%
I wasn't even like a hard
liberal, I was just like, well,

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:52.572
no, I'm a liberal person
and I believe in, you know,

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:55.108 align:start size:97% position:3%
basic liberal ideals,
which most of us really do.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:57.977 align:start size:97% position:3%
Even even the quite
conservative people will say,

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.313
"Well actually, yeah, I mean
obviously I want rule of law,

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:02.181
freedom of speech
and property rights

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.682
and all these sorts
of things, right"

00:03:03.682 --> 00:03:05.184
Fairly basic stuff.

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:06.719
