00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:23.937 align:start size:88% position:13%
You know, it's actually
been quite far on

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:25.838 align:start size:84% position:16%
that you've got Hasan
Piker being like,

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:27.073
"Yes, I'm a communist.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:30.076
Here's my red flag,"
you know, behind him.

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.511
Which is, you know,
okay, fair enough.

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:33.279
At least the mask's off, right?

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because before they would
say, "I'm a liberal,

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
but everything around
you is racist and we need

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.150
to redistribute all the wealth."

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.085
- Right, right, right.

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.352
- Seize all the property.

00:03:40.352 --> 00:03:41.620
I'm like, that's not
