the mantle of liberalism.

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:44.824
That would be nice.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:46.325
That would be nice.

00:03:46.325 --> 00:03:47.460
Because they're actually
the most illiberal people

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.627
