00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:49.995 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Of course, and
they know it as well.

00:03:49.995 --> 00:03:51.197
That's the thing.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.464 align:start size:88% position:13%
They are well aware
