00:03:58.137 --> 00:03:59.772 align:start size:97% position:3%
- But wait, before we get
to them and everything else.

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:02.542
What, so it's 2011, 2012,
you're saying, you know,

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:05.678 align:start size:97% position:3%
"I'm just kind of a
liberal, I'm a liberal guy."

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:06.912
But now you're doing
some stuff on YouTube

00:04:06.912 --> 00:04:09.115
or what was waking
you up that kind

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.850
