the industry as a whole.

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was just like,
"Okay, well what is this?"

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:26.199 align:start size:97% position:3%
I looked into it and I was
like, "Okay, this isn't really

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:27.567
