00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.325
And I think...

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:55.194
And looking back, right, I
watched my very first video

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:57.263
a few years ago,
man, I was naive.

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:58.197
(Dave laughing)

00:04:58.197 --> 00:04:59.399
- [Carl] Man, I was naive.

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.033 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Well, we all
were, we all were.

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:01.233
- Right?

00:05:01.233 --> 00:05:02.701
And we were, yeah,
we genuinely were.

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:05.471
It was, it was like, "Okay,
why don't I just explain

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.173
