not a misogynist, you know,

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.449
why would you even say that?

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.817
It's fair for me to have a
critique of your philosophy.

00:05:18.817 --> 00:05:20.053
And they're like, "No,
you just hate women."

00:05:20.053 --> 00:05:21.287
It's like, "Oh, right, okay."

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:22.688
You know, but of
course, you know,

00:05:22.688 --> 00:05:24.557 align:start size:81% position:19%
water off a duck's
back these days

00:05:24.557 --> 00:05:27.292
because you can't critique
Black Lives Matter, feminism

00:05:27.292 --> 00:05:29.361
or anything that without being
an ist and a phobe, you know,

00:05:29.361 --> 00:05:32.164
