philosophers,

00:06:17.176 --> 00:06:19.445
but you can name dozens
of left wing ones, right.

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:21.914 align:start size:84% position:16%
You know, and so
it's kind of annoying

00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:23.316
that the conservatives
are actually quite bad

00:06:23.316 --> 00:06:24.817
at telegraphing their message

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.251
because actually it's a
really wholesome message.

00:06:26.251 --> 00:06:28.020
You know, really what's
the most important thing

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.522
in your life?

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:30.756
Well, your family actually,
the people who depend on you.

00:06:30.756 --> 00:06:32.024
You know, and so I've
kind of been leaning

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:33.192
into that a bit more.

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:34.627 align:start size:88% position:13%
But you know, I've
still got the same sort

00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:36.829
