have a better term for it.

00:07:14.966 --> 00:07:16.402 align:start position:0%
You know, 'cause everything
else seems to be well left wing

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:17.436
philosophy.
- Right.

00:07:17.436 --> 00:07:18.871
- Well, I guess, you know,

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:20.739 align:start size:97% position:3%
but what we're really trying
to do is just properly

00:07:20.739 --> 00:07:23.542
understand the sort of
metaphysics of what it is

00:07:23.542 --> 00:07:26.311
we actually assume
all day, every day.

00:07:26.311 --> 00:07:28.080
'Cause we never talk
about the importance

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
of not just family, 'cause
it's easy to say that.

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:31.350
And it's trite to say that.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:33.219 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's like, okay, what
about the family,

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.486
actually is it this important?

00:07:34.486 --> 00:07:36.388
And it's really the
bonds of reliability

00:07:36.388 --> 00:07:37.656
on the person, right?

00:07:37.656 --> 00:07:40.125
'Cause one thing having
four kids has taught me,

00:07:40.125 --> 00:07:42.861 align:start size:88% position:13%
it's the predictability
of each day

00:07:42.861 --> 00:07:45.231
is what's really good
for the your children.

00:07:45.231 --> 00:07:46.732
It's really what they need.

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:48.801
They need to wake up and
know, dad's gonna do this,

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:50.302
mom's gonna do this.

00:07:50.302 --> 00:07:51.870
I'm gonna go to school and
everything will be the same

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.005 align:start size:97% position:3%
as it was yesterday and
it'll be the same tomorrow.

00:07:54.005 --> 00:07:57.009
And so they can genuinely be
happy in the world around them.

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.544 align:start position:0%
And then when you start
thinking like this, you realize,

00:07:58.544 --> 00:08:01.480
God, the people in charge
are totally irresponsible

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.282
with everything in our state.

00:08:03.282 --> 00:08:04.517 align:start size:84% position:16%
You know, everything
in the country,

00:08:04.517 --> 00:08:06.051
everything in the
west, you know?

00:08:06.051 --> 00:08:08.988
They're just so cavalier with
the decisions that they make.

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:12.024
And it's like, God, how
can they think like this?

00:08:12.024 --> 00:08:14.927
And I think a lot of it is
